#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:8
msgid "Exception"
msgstr "Iznimka"

#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:13
msgid ""
"All exceptions have readable ``value`` and ``errno`` attributes, not just "
"``StopIteration`` and ``OSError``."
msgstr ""
"Sve iznimke imaju čitljive atribute ``value`` i ``errno``, ne samo "
"``StopIteration`` i ``OSError``."

#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:15
msgid "**Cause:** MicroPython is optimised to reduce code size."
msgstr "**Uzrok:** MicroPython je optimiziran za smanjenje veličine koda."

#: ../../genrst/builtin_types.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Only use ``value`` on ``StopIteration`` exceptions, and "
"``errno`` on ``OSError`` exceptions.  Do not use or rely on these attributes"
" on other exceptions."
msgstr ""
"**Zaobilazno rješenje:** Koristite ``value`` samo na iznimkama "
"``StopIteration``, a ``errno`` samo na iznimkama ``OSError``. Ne koristite "
"se ovim atributima na ostalim iznimkama niti se na njih oslanjajte."

